## 🚀 Featured Projects

### 🛡️ AI-Based Intrusion Detection System

* ML model to detect cyber attacks in network traffic
* Trained on real-world datasets (NSL-KDD)
* Classifies attacks like DoS, Probe

---

### 🔐 AI Phishing URL Detector

* Detects malicious URLs using ML + heuristics
* Feature extraction from URL patterns
* Generates risk score

---

### 💼 AI Resume Analyzer

* NLP-based resume evaluation system
* ATS score + keyword matching
* Helps optimize resumes

